{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When games were about skill \u2014 not shortcuts.</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when games didn\u2019t hook you with story, but with challenge? <strong>Game Over Please</strong> was born from that spirit.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No long tutorials. No checkpoints. No mercy. Just you, the mouse, and <strong>95 levels</strong> that demand precision and patience in true arcade fashion.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is quick. Every success feels earned. That\u2019s what makes it impossible to stop.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple, but the execution is unforgiving \u2014 just like the classics.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean visuals, fair physics, and a minimal soundtrack create a rhythm of trial and error where progress comes through <strong>skill, not luck</strong>.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you miss the time when games were about mastering control \u2014 not just winning \u2014 this is your proving ground.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95 handcrafted levels:</strong> A steady climb in difficulty and precision challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure arcade focus:</strong> Simple controls, no distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fair, tough gameplay:</strong> Every failure teaches; every victory is earned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro atmosphere:</strong> Minimal art and sound for that old-school tension.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No tricks. No excuses. Just skill.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BE ABNORMAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155320/e3c60d30ed44435f00e910ba2e886782331564c6.jpg"},{"name":"BE NORMAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3155320/12a9f839b25252124c0ced209862ac6849d463e7.jpg"},{"name":"I'M A SQUARE","path"